{
  "name": "Zero Results Fixer · 01 Weekly scan",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Zero Results Fixer · 01 Weekly scan\nFinds searches that returned no products, asks Claude why, tests Claude's proposed fix against the real search, and emails the owner a list to approve.\n\n**Nothing changes in the shop until a person approves it** in workflow 02.\n\nSource of searches: `query_source_url` in zrf_settings. In the demo this is the Search Relevance Lab's list of real shopper searches. In a real shop, replace the first HTTP node with your search log (a sheet, BigQuery or your search tool's export).",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 520
      },
      "id": "91181b57-7dd0-5257-8862-206ece65e16d",
      "name": "About",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -260,
        -420
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Every proposal is tested first\nThe rewrite is run against the same search before the owner sees it. Proposals that still return nothing are marked `fix_failed_test` and listed, not sent for approval.",
        "height": 180,
        "width": 360,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "2e1fb7c5-cc48-5e6f-8a13-d4af00a8b6e7",
      "name": "Test before asking",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        500,
        560
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "weeks",
              "triggerAtDay": [
                1
              ],
              "triggerAtHour": 7
            }
          ]
        }
      },
